# GitHub Actions deploy tokens (gitignored). One-time setup:
#
# 1. Supabase: https://supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens → Create token
# 2. Vercel: https://vercel.com/account/tokens → Create classic token (not OAuth)
#
# Copy to .env.github-secrets.local then run:
#   node scripts/sync-github-secrets-from-local.mjs
#
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=sbp_...
# VERCEL_TOKEN=...
